    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Here at Byrne Malone Estate Agents, we are delighted to present No. 2580 Dara Park to the market for sale by private treaty. Ideally located within a mature and well-established development, this well-located home is within walking distance of Newbridge Train Station and Newbridge town centre. The area offers an excellent range of amenities including both primary and secondary schools, the popular Whitewater Shopping Centre, along with Tesco, Dunnes Stores, and a wide selection of coffee shops, pubs and restaurants. The M7 Motorway is also only a few minutes drive away, making this an ideal location for commuters.\nThis home offers comfortable and family-friendly accommodation comprising a sitting room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms, a family bathroom and an attic conversion for storage.\nOn entering the property, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting hallway. To the left lies the sitting room, complete with carpeting, decorative coving, an open fireplace and a large picture window that fills the room with natural light. To the rear of the home is a bright and spacious L-shaped kitchen/dining area, offering excellent space for family living and entertaining.\nUpstairs, the stairs and all three bedrooms are carpeted. Each of the bedrooms benefits from built-in wardrobes providing excellent storage. A neatly tiled family bathroom completes the upstairs accommodation.\nOutside, the property features a front garden, while the rear garden includes a large block-built shed, providing extra storage space. The garden also benefits from rear access.\nThis ideal family home is a commuters dream, with the M7 Motorway just a five-minute drive away and Newbridge Train Station only a five-minute walk from the property, offering regular direct services to Dublin Heuston Station.\nViewing is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
